- Rampaging Baloths 6/6\n\
- Canopy Baloth 4/3  \n\
- Oashra Cultivator 0/3\n\
\n\
3 blockers blocking my 3 biggest (Invoker 5, Warmaster 3, Rejuvenator/token 2) = 10 damage prevented. 18-10 = 8. Exactly lethal!\n\
\n\
