      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Passed with 1 untapped Forest and Elven Bow as the only castable spell. The mana would go completely unused. Even without paying the {2} kicker, having the equipment on the battlefield is pure upside - it can be equipped later for +1/+2 and reach.",
