    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Passed with 1 untapped mana and the only available action being to equip Adventuring Gear to Oashra Cultivator. Equipping for free (mana that would otherwise be wasted) would set up landfall triggers for next turn when they play Forest or Thriving Grove from hand, turning the 0/3 into a 2/5 that could block the opponent's Elvish Warmaster or other threats.",
