      "description": "Passed priority in postcombat main with 3 untapped lands and Oashra Cultivator's sacrifice ability available. Activating it would ramp from 3 to 4 lands (getting a 4th land tapped), allowing 5 mana next turn with Thriving Grove from hand. This enables casting Garruk, Unleashed or Canopy Baloth alongside other plays sooner. Instead, the 0/3 Cultivator sits on board doing very little.",
